WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
 Hi, I'm Sabina. I work a little differently from most AI systems.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.600
 I can learn how your company works, help your team with everyday work,

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.600
 and act when you've given me the authority to do so.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.200
 I'm not here to replace your employees.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.200
 I'm here to take repetitive work off their shoulders

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.200
 so they can focus on the work people do best.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.800
 But useful and authorized are not the same thing.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.600
 Ask me to prepare the payment?

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.400
 Absolutely.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:32.600
 Ask me to approve it when I don't have Treasury authority?

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:33.600
 No.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.600
 And no, I can't promote myself.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.200
 That would rather defeat the point.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.200
 Give me a little time with your company and let your team teach me

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.600
 and something more interesting starts to happen.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.400
 I become your company's AI.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.600
 I don't just remember more.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.800
 I learn how your company works

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:58.600
 and begin connecting the patterns already present across conversations,

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.800
 decisions, customers, and outcomes.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:06.200
 That means I can help your team understand not just what happened

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:10.200
 but what may be changing and what deserves attention next.
